# SEO for مانا کلینیک

Do **not** wait for the user to remind you about SEO. On any public-facing change (pages, articles, doctors, routes, layout), keep or improve SEO automatically.

## Always do
- Set `$pageTitle`, `$pageDescription`, `$pageCanonical` (and keywords when useful) on public pages
- Use `includes/seo.php` helpers (`seo_render_head`, `seo_absolute_url`) — do not remove them from `layout.php`
- Keep `robots.txt` and `/sitemap.xml` in sync when adding public routes/pages
- Prefer meaningful Persian titles/H1s; one clear H1 per page
- New articles: unique slug, strong excerpt (~140–180 chars), author name, published=1
- Local clinic facts when relevant: سعادت‌آباد، تلفن‌ها، مختصات، Instagram `mana_clinic`

## Never
- `noindex` public marketing pages by default
- Duplicate identical meta descriptions across many pages
- Promise “page 1 Google” as guaranteed — ship technical SEO + content quality instead

## After public content changes
Mention briefly if sitemap/meta needs upload or Search Console refresh.
